    <description>Suzuki GSX-R1000 M7 (RH850), 2 MB read, sw 32990-48L30 (ECM 32990-48L3x). 791 maps auto-ported from Hayabusa Gen3 via on-bin descriptors (420 HIGH, 234 MED=verify, 137 unknown) + 3287 scalars/flags found by Ghidra V850 decompile (generic titles + context hints, UNVERIFIED). Scaling is the Hayabusa&#x27;s, unverified here. Re-stamp field-1 CRC (0x10000-0x1FFAFB @0x1FFAFE) with tools/fix_field1_crc.py. UNVERIFIED ON HARDWARE.</description>
    <author>Clint Chipley / Claude</author>
